WEBVTT

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.576
So deep was my hurt

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:05.336
at seeing Tom Coleman
murder Jonathan before my eyes,

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.256
that I became a silent person,

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.040
and I did not speak

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.200
for six months.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:21.056
I finally learned to touch that hurt in me

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.576
as I became older

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.976
and began to talk about
the Southern freedom movement,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.816
and began to connect my stories